# ⚡ VORTEX 2.0 — Project Overview

## Non-AI Robotic Companion System

> **Sense. Respond. Move.**

---

## 1. Project Introduction

**VORTEX 2.0** is an advanced experimental robotics platform designed to combine **embedded systems, mobile robotics, voice interaction, environmental sensing, IoT, smart-home automation, and human-machine interaction** into a single integrated system.

The project is the next-generation evolution of the original VORTEX platform. While the first version focused primarily on voice-controlled robotic movement and smart-home appliance control, VORTEX 2.0 expands the concept toward a more complete **robotic companion system**.

VORTEX 2.0 is intentionally designed as a **Non-AI Robot System**. Its core functions are achieved using predefined commands, programmed logic, sensors, microcontrollers, communication protocols, and physical actuators rather than artificial-intelligence models.

The project is intended to serve as both a functional robotic prototype and a platform for learning, experimentation, and future development.

