# 8. Main System Components

## 8.1 ESP32 Main Controller

The ESP32 is the central processing unit of the robot.

It manages:

* Voice commands
* Motor movement
* Ultrasonic sensing
* Temperature and humidity sensing
* OLED interface
* Audio feedback
* Wi-Fi connectivity
* Blynk communication
* Robot control logic

---

## 8.2 ESP8266 Appliance Controller

The ESP8266 acts as a dedicated home-automation controller.

It receives commands through the Blynk IoT infrastructure and operates a four-channel relay module.

### Appliance Mapping

| Relay   | Appliance   |
| ------- | ----------- |
| Relay 1 | Fan         |
| Relay 2 | Light       |
| Relay 3 | Water Motor |
| Relay 4 | Television  |

This separation allows the robot controller and appliance controller to operate as independent embedded systems.

