# 16. Power System

The VORTEX platform is designed around a rechargeable lithium-ion battery system.

The conceptual power architecture consists of:

```text
3S 18650 Battery Pack
          │
          ▼
        3S BMS
          │
     ┌────┴────┐
     │         │
     ▼         ▼
 Motor Rail  LM2596
                 │
                 ▼
            Logic Supply
```

The power system must provide appropriate voltage and current for:

* Motors
* ESP32
* ESP8266
* Sensors
* OLED
* DFPlayer
* Relay system

Power distribution and regulation should be validated for the actual hardware configuration before deployment.

